    "data": "<h1 style=\"margin: 16px 0; font-size: 26px !important;\">Biliboard术力口周榜</h1><p>创刊于2024年6月12日，继承自日本Billboard周榜，收录包括但不限于使用VOCALOID、UTAU、SynthesizerV、CEVIO、初音ミクNT等音声合成引擎制作的歌曲（统称“术曲”），旨在针对B站的流行趋势对术曲排名，并传播日本虚拟歌姬文化。</p><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img class=\"cut-off-6\" alt=\"cut-off-6\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/article/02db465212d3c374a43c60fa2625cc1caeaab796.png\"></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">排名计算方式</h1><p>0、数据统计周期为上周周二12点至本周周二12点</p><p>1、时间修正</p><p>t = LOG(EXP(DATE([投稿日期])-DATE([最近一期周榜的发布时间的前一天]))/14 + 1)+1</p><p>2、得分计算</p><p>播放基数 = 新增播放 * 时间修正</p><p>得分 = 播放基数 + 新增收藏 * 30 + 新增点赞 * 3 + 新增硬币 * 10 + (投票比值 + 100%) * 播放基数</p><p>投票&amp;提名网站: <a href=\"https://aquarite.uk\">https://aquarite.uk</a></p><p>排名并不完全等同于歌曲质量，请理性看待！</p><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img class=\"cut-off-5\" alt=\"cut-off-5\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/article/4adb9255ada5b97061e610b682b8636764fe50ed.png\"></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 20 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cZw9eDERz/\" target=\"_blank\">心灵感应</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/02dae0d6f830ade998a29b3a567e0d8a7f158203.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 19 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15J4m1A7qy/\" target=\"_blank\">催眠师</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/c4496e1c95132a8dd859f9ad52d92a7e58efec75.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 18 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13e7PztEGd/\" target=\"_blank\">回复还没好吗？大叔式发言！</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/9c364ebd891fd2fc0eecc763d6b22d492e47506a.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 17 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1K8KUzUEdX/\" target=\"_blank\">克隆克隆</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/4ac72e591b13acea2cd09b9f8037fcd736f11ce9.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 16 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vqQUYYEmg/\" target=\"_blank\">超级超级超级超级超级讨厌</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/fd885be84d32fbfa4328a59cb40cb47034ec18e6.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 15 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XDgAz3EzK/\" target=\"_blank\">限界魔术</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/558543bb9e862d34b9310f9eaf9b5854aedf1bd2.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 14 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1xAVezxEkw/\" target=\"_blank\">怪物之歌</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ef1239179dbcf92fea88bb21c606182afbb2a3a8.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 13 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MqKXz8Epm/\" target=\"_blank\">春岚</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/4709a1516efb9566